"The firmware includes the :doc:`/library/omv.fir` driver for an externally "
"wired **AMG8833** 8 × 8 thermal imager. Connect the module to the I²C bus "
"listed below, then read frames with ``fir.init()`` + ``fir.snapshot()``::"
msgstr ""
"Firmware mencakup driver :doc:`/library/omv.fir` untuk **AMG8833** 8 × 8 "
"thermal imager yang dihubungkan secara eksternal. Hubungkan modul ke bus I²C"
" yang tercantum di bawah ini, lalu baca bingkai dengan ``fir.init()`` + "
"``fir.snapshot()``\\ ::"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-ae3.rst:795
msgid ""
"The ``fir`` driver only talks to the sensor over **I²C 1** — wire the module"
" to ``P4`` (SCL) and ``P5`` (SDA)."
msgstr ""
"Driver ``fir`` hanya berkomunikasi dengan sensor melalui **I²C 1** — "
"hubungkan modul ke ``P4`` (SCL) dan ``P5`` (SDA)."

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-ae3.rst:799
msgid "Timing"
msgstr "Waktu"

